{"node":{"id":"MONDO:0010156","label":"Troyer syndrome","definition":"Autosomal recessive spastic paraplegia type 20 (SPG20) is a type of complex hereditary spastic paraplegia characterized by an onset in infancy of progressive spastic paraparesis associated with distal amyotrophy, psuedobulbar palsy, motor and cognitive delays, mild cerebellar signs (dysarthria, dysdiadochokinesia, mild intention tremor), short stature and subtle skeletal abnormalities (pes cavus, mild talipes equinovarus, kyphoscoliosis). SPG20 is due to mutations in the SPG20 gene (13q13.1), which encodes the protein spartin.","synonyms":["Cross-McKusick syndrome","SPG20","autosomal recessive spastic paraplegia type 20","childhood-onset spastic paraparesis-distal muscle wasting syndrome","spastic paraplegia 20","spastic paraplegia 20 (Troyer syndrome)","spastic paraplegia 20, autosomal recessive"],"xrefs":["DOID:0050886","GARD:0005372","ICD9:335.29","MEDGEN:97950","MESH:C536858","OMIM:275900","Orphanet:101000","SCTID:230264003","UMLS:C0393559"],"parents":[],"parents_labels":{},"children":[],"children_labels":{},"in_core":false,"cluster_id":6,"is_group":false,"n_genes":1,"n_phenotypes":74,"mechanism_classes":[]},"genes":[{"id":"e_df2916105357","source":"MONDO:0010156","target":"SPART","type":"caused_by","evidence":[{"db":"Orphanet","origin":"Orphanet","record":"ORPHA:101000","level":"curated","date":"2026-06-23","url":"https://www.orpha.net/en/disease/detail/101000","confidence":0.95,"snippet":"Disease-causing germline mutation(s) in (Assessed) — spartin"},{"db":"HPO","origin":"Orphanet","record":"ORPHA:101000","level":"curated","date":"2026-09-02","confidence":0.9,"url":"https://hpo.jax.org/browse/disease/ORPHA:101000","snippet":"SPART is annotated as disease gene of ORPHA:101000 (HPO genes_to_phenotype, Orphanet-derived)"}],"contradicting":[],"confidence":0.95,"independent_sources":["Orphanet"],"level":"curated"}],"phenotypes":[{"edge":{"id":"e_a9e0e2ef7fcd","source":"MONDO:0010156","target":"HP